title: Relink configuration
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

From time to time, you may want to re-title action, project or contact tiddlers.

To ensure other tiddlers get updated when you re-title, install [[Relink|https://flibbles.github.io/tw5-relink/]], and to import them the following tiddlers by dragging-and-dropping them into your wiki:

* [[$:/config/flibbles/relink/fields/gsd_project]]
* [[$:/config/flibbles/relink/fields/gsd_prerequisites]]
* [[$:/config/flibbles/relink/fields/gsd_contact]] -- only if you also use the [[HyperGSD Contacts|$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd-contacts]] sub-plugin